    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "iMago is a virtual, interactive, immersive and transmedia platform, which
    shares the theoretical and experimental production of our study group, involved
    with issues relating to landscape, architecture, urbanism, design, philosophy,
    anthropology, education, projection and diversification of technological futures.\n\nLabGEIST
    is the experimental and poetic tentacle of the Technology Imaginary Study Group
    - GEIST. In it, we get our hands dirty, rehearse new ways of understanding and
    using present technologies and speculate about future technologies, repositioning
    the narratives and meanings related to technical objects.\n\nGEIST is a component
    of the CNPq research group Representa\xE7\xF5es: Imagin\xE1rio e Tecnologia -
    RITe. It is a transdisciplinary group that aims to discuss texts on the philosophy,
    history and anthropology of techniques and develop methodologies for the investigation
    of technological imaginaries.\n\n\nMore information:\n<color=#000>plataformaimago.wordpress.com</color>"
